window.docContents[114].resolve({"/LindenstraussPolynomials/Compositions/#mod-doc-LindenstraussPolynomials___Compositions-1-0":{"contents":"Control of ordered compositions\n\nIterating the deficit identity controls the deficits along ordered compositions of substitutions (eq:vbase, eq:vcompositions), with a bound (7K_n)^d\\alpha_{i_1} and a scalar that does not depend on the parameters t_i — which is what Lemma lem:geometry needs.\n\n\n","context":"","header":"LindenstraussPolynomials.Compositions","id":"/LindenstraussPolynomials/Compositions/#mod-doc-LindenstraussPolynomials___Compositions-1-0"}});